  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together for a richer society - Protection</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norwegian Church Aid Burkina Faso&#x2019;s SGBV programme supports women and girls at risk of violence with access to lifesaving services and safe spaces. It strengthens local organisations and promotes SRH awareness, empowerment, and resilience.The response will be implemented by two local partners, Sos Jeunesse and the Buaminyaba association, and Norwegian Church Aids office, across the regions East, Boucle de Mouhoun and South.</narrative>
  </description>
